            °° na bsgyur ba la skad dang po prad snya pa ra me ti dang u pa de sha dang shra stra dang y b+hi sa ma ya dang a lang ka ra dang na ma dang pri ti rnams ni rim pa bzhin du | <note type="editorial">This gives as the base text name (with mistakes): abhisamayālaṃkāravṛtti (ID:3711) </note> 2 pa la shes rab kyi <lb n="2a9"/> pha rol du phyin pa dang man ngag dang bstan bcos dang mngon par rtogs pa dang rgyan dang zhes bya ba dang 'grel pa zhes bya ba'o || ¦ ci 3 dang gi 1 la tshig phrad yin pas sgra ded med do ||</seg> </ab>

