            dang po ni <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3786">slob dpon lo tsha ba chen po</rs>'i zhal snga nas rgyun mtha'i dus 2 par mkhyen 3 gyi ngo bo <expan>ye shes</expan> kyi chos sku dang por thob pa ni yum yin la |</seg><gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="3b"/><lb n="12a9"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex15012024-11-08-11-292" status="finalized">
            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3807">'bre chen po</rs> na re yum sras yin pas rgyu 'bras su mi 'gyur ste rnam par bzhag 'jog gi yum sras yin pa'i phyir ba glang dang nog lkog shal <expan>bzhin</expan> no || 
             'di ltar gzhi shes rnaM 'jog rgyu nyan rang 'phags pa rnam
         <pb n="12b"/>
            <lb n="12b1"/> bzhag 'bras bu | lam shes rnam 'jog rgyu byang chub <expan>sems dpa'</expan> rnam bzhag 'bras bu | rnam mkhyen rnam 'jog rgyu <expan>sangs rgyas</expan> rnaM bzhag 'bras bu yin ste | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="work:5633">mdo</rs> las ko'u shi ka nga'i dngos po'i sku 'di mnyes pas ni de <expan>bzhin</expan> gshegs pa zhes bya ba'i grangs su mi 'gro yis | rnam pa <expan>thams cad</expan> mkhyen pa nyid mnyes pas ni de <expan>bzhin</expan> gshegs pa zhes bya ba'i grangs
            <lb n="12b2"/> su 'gro'o zhes gsungs pa dang | </seg>

