            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3745">jo bo a ti sha</rs>'i zhal nas skar phung nang gi <expan>nam mkha'</expan> mthong pa dang <expan>nam mkha'</expan> chen po mthong pa la <expan>nam mkha'i</expan> ngo bo mthong pa la khyad par med kyang | rgya che chung la mthong pa'i khyad par yod <lb n="48a5"/> pa <expan>bzhin</expan> du sa bcu'i mnyaM bzhag na chos nyid kyi ngo bo mthong pa la khyad par med kyang rgya che chung mthong pa'i khyad par yod pa <expan>yin no</expan> zhes gsung go || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
