            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:6949">jo bo a du la</rs> na re <expan>nyon mongs</expan> pa la nus pa <expan>bzhi</expan> ste | sdug bsngal skyed pa dang | gnyen po yis kyi gegs byed pa dang | srid pa'i lus 'dzin pa dang | rigs mthun phyi ma skyed pa'o || 
             de la dang po 2 byang chub <expan>sems dpa'</expan> la mi mkho bas spong la phyi ma 2 mkho bas <lb n="87b2"/> mi spong ste nyes pa mi skyed pa'i phyir sngags kyis bcom pa'i dug <expan>bzhin</expan> no zhes zer ro || 
            de dgag pa la 3 ste |</seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
