         <ab>
            <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="88b"/><lb n="88b2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex15012024-11-08-11-293" status="finalized">dang po ni 
            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3807">'bre chen
            <lb n="88b3"/> po</rs>'i zhal nas mdo dang bstan bcos nas laM shes nyid bshad pa yin pas 'dir yang nyan thos kyi laM dang | tshul ji ltar shes par byed pa 2 kyis shes par bya'o || 
            dang po bden pa 4 la rnaM pa mi rtag laswo <expan>bcu drug</expan> gang zag gi bdag med par mthong pa dang de goms par byed pa'i laM 2 yin la | de 'dra ba rang rgyal ba dang byang chub <expan>sems dpa'i</expan> rgyud la skyes kyang nyan thos kyi laM du <expan>bzhag go</expan> ||
            <lb n="88b4"/> 2 pa ni sbyor ba'i dus su byang chub mchog tu <expan>sems can</expan> bskyed pa dang | dngos gzhi mi rtag pa 'swo pa bden par mi dmigs pa dang | rjes dge ba'i rtsa ba zla na med pa'i byang chub du bsngo ba'i seMs kyis zin pa'o zhes 'dod do || 
            de ni ma yin te |</seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
         <gap reason="omitted"/>
         
         <ab>
            <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="89b"/><lb n="89b8"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex15012024-11-08-11-294" status="finalized">
            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3807">'bre chen po</rs> ltar laM shes la sbyar nas kyang bshad de | shes par bya zhes pa khyad par gyi gzhi yin la | de'i khyad par gyi chos la gang dang | gang gis dang | ji ltar shes par bya ba'o ||
             dang po ni nyan thos laM 'di'o || de nyid gang zhe na 'phags pa'i bden pa dang dag gi rnaM pa rtogs pa'o || 2 pa ni laM shes nyid kyis so || <lb n="89b9"/> 3 pa ni rnaM pa mi <choice><reg>dmigs</reg><orig>rig</orig></choice> pa'i sgo nas so || 
            'grel par khyad par gyi gzhi dang | khyad par gyi chos so || 
            dang po ni de ltar yongs su shes par bya'o zhes pa'o ||  
            2 pa la gang shes par bya ba dang | ji ltar shes par bya ba dang | skabs gang du shes par bya ba dang | rang <expan>bzhin</expan> cir shes par bya ba dang | gang zag gang gis shes par byed pa rnaMs ni de la dang ngo bo nyid dang | laM shis nyid dang ¦ nyan <pb n="90a"/><lb n="90a1"/> thos dang | byang chub ces yang rnaMs rim pa <expan>bzhin</expan> no || 
            2 pa nges 'byed cha mthun la bden pa dang zhes pa <expan>la sogs</expan> pas 'tshaM sbyar nas | byang chub <expan>sems dpa'i</expan> nges pa byed cha mthun bden pa <expan>bzhi</expan> ngo bo dang khyad par gyis stong par rtogs pa'i nang du nyan thos kyis nges byed cha mthun 'dus pa la de'i nges 'byed cha mthun zhes brjod do || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
