         <ab>
            <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="98b"/><lb n="98b3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex15012024-11-08-12-202" status="finalized">'byed pa'i rgyu mtshan ni <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:5838"><expan>slob dpon</expan> 'phags pa</rs> ltar na ched du bya ba gzhan gyi don du dngos su rang don dang rang gzhan 2 ka'i don dang gzhan don 'bas zhig sgrub pa las rim pa <expan>bzhin</expan> du rang don dang | 2 don <lb n="98b4"/> dang | gzhan don gyi mos pa 3 du phye bar bshad la | <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3786"><expan>slob dpon</expan> lo tsha ba</rs> ni <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:3746">mdo sde rgyan</rs> las | <quote><lg><l>phal cher don med don yod dang ||</l> <l>rnaM kun don yod shes bya ste</l></lg></quote> zhes pa'i rjes su 'brangs nas chos mchog man chad dang sa dang po nas bdun pa'i bar dang dag pa sa 3 rang don dang 2 don dang gzhan don gyi mos pa zhes bzhed pa ni | 'di nas bya ba 'di ni bsgom pa'i laM zhes pa <lb n="93b5"/> dang <expan>'gal lo</expan> ||</seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
